# UK Garage Warped Sub Bass Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 38
  i note1 38
  i note2 45
  i note3 43
  i note4 38
  i note5 45
